{"id":"662002","name":"萝卜团","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/662002/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"粳米粉","amount":"260克"},{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"100克"},{"name":"萝卜","amount":"580克"}],"sub":[{"name":"里脊肉","amount":"115克"},{"name":"五香脆皮干","amount":"125克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：粳米粉、糯米粉。","img":"images/662002/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"萝卜（已清洗）、里脊肉（已清洗）、五香脆皮干、香葱。","img":"images/662002/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"粽叶。","img":"images/662002/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将五香脆皮干拆开包装取出125克放在案板上。","img":"images/662002/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切成粒。","img":"images/662002/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将里脊肉放在案板上切成粒。","img":"images/662002/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"将萝卜用擦菜板擦成丝。","img":"images/662002/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"随后，将萝卜丝下入沸水锅中焯开捞出。","img":"images/662002/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"用清水过过凉。","img":"images/662002/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"将过凉好的萝卜丝挤干水分。","img":"images/662002/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"起锅倒油烧热，下入切好的里脊肉翻炒翻炒。","img":"images/662002/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"再加适量的料酒。","img":"images/662002/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加适量的酱油。","img":"images/662002/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"翻炒翻炒。","img":"images/662002/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"接下来，合入萝卜丝和切好的五香脆皮干、加适量的盐。","img":"images/662002/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"加适量的味精。","img":"images/662002/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"调味炒匀。","img":"images/662002/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"搁入香葱盛出。","img":"images/662002/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"晾凉。","img":"images/662002/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"接着，在和面机倒入260克粳米粉。","img":"images/662002/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"倒入100克糯米粉。","img":"images/662002/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"先加入190克开水。","img":"images/662002/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"看情况再加适量的开水和成团。","img":"images/662002/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"然后，在硅胶垫上加入适量的干糯米粉、和好的面团。","img":"images/662002/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"分50克左右的面剂子。","img":"images/662002/step_25.jpg"},{"step":26,"desc":"取一个剂子，放上萝卜馅。","img":"images/662002/step_26.jpg"},{"step":27,"desc":"像包汤圆一样包好。","img":"images/662002/step_27.jpg"},{"step":28,"desc":"放入垫粽叶的蒸锅中。","img":"images/662002/step_28.jpg"},{"step":29,"desc":"盖上盖、开锅蒸20分钟关火焖2分钟。","img":"images/662002/step_29.jpg"},{"step":30,"desc":"最后，开盖取出。","img":"images/662002/step_30.jpg"},{"step":31,"desc":"装盘，晾凉一下可以吃了。","img":"images/662002/step_31.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}